tered-office-in-australia/">KSL Change of Registered Office in Australia</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/change-of-directors-interest-notice-2/">Change of Director&#8217;s Interest Notice</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/kina-securities-ltd-appoints-new-director-karen-smith-pomeroy/">Kina Securities Ltd Appoints New Director &#8211; Karen Smith-Pomeroy</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-interim-dividend-exchange-rate-to-be-used/">KSL &#8211; Interim dividend &#8211; exchange rate to be used</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-form-3-notice-of-substantial-shareholding/">KSL: Form 3 Notice of Substantial Shareholding</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-interim-dividend-information/">KSL Interim Dividend Information</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-half-year-results-investor-presentation/">KSL Half Year Results Investor Presentation</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-half-year-results-media-release/">KSL Half Year Results &#8211; Media Release</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-appendix-4d-30-june-2016/">KSL Appendix 4D 30 June 2016</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-signed-half-year-financial-statements/">KSL Signed Half Year Financial Statements</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-releases-shares-from-voluntary-escrow/">KSL Releases Shares from Voluntary Escrow</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/asx-announcement-ksl-extension-of-escrow-arrangements/">ASX Announcement: KSL &#8211; Extension of Escrow Arrangements</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/kina-securities-ltd-appendix-3y-change-of-directors-interests/">Kina Securities Ltd &#8211; Appendix 3Y &#8211; change of Director&#8217;s Interests</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/asx-announcement-asx-ksl-3-august-2016/">ASX Announcement (ASX: KSL) 3 August 2016</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/kina-securities-ltd-extension-of-voluntary-escrow/">Kina Securities Ltd Extension of Voluntary Escrow</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-form-5-notice-of-cessation-of-substantial-shareholding/">KSL; Form 5: Notice of Cessation Of Substantial Shareholding</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-notice-of-substantial-shareholding/">KSL: Notice of Substantial Shareholding</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/asx-announcement-asx-ksl-8-july-2016/">ASX ANNOUNCEMENT (ASX: KSL) 8 JULY 2016</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/23-june-2016-updated-trading-policy/">23 June 2016 Updated Trading Policy</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-notice-of-cessation-of-substantial-shareholding/">KSL Notice of Cessation of Substantial Shareholding</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/notice-of-substantial-shareholding/">KSL Notice of Substantial Shareholding</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/2016-annual-general-meeting-presentation/">2016 Annual General Meeting Presentation</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/kina-announce-agm-results/">Kina announce AGM Results</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/kina-md-agm-speech/">Kina MD AGM speech</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-media-release-agm/">KSL &#8211; Media Release AGM</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/kina-appoints-new-director/">Kina appoints new Director</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/774-2/">Initial Director’s Interest Notice &#8211; Appendix 3X</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/notice-of-annual-meeting/">Notice of Annual Meeting</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/2015-annual-report-for-kina-securities-limited/">2015 Annual Report for Kina Securities Limited</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-corrected-appendix-3b/">KSL &#8211; Corrected Appendix 3B</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ksl-amendments-to-appendix-4e/">KSL &#8211; Amendments to Appendix 4E</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/change-of-directors-interest-notice/">Change of Director’s Interest Notice</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/notification-of-dividend-distribution/">Notification of dividend / distribution</a></li></ul><br /></div><h2 class="tabtitle">Company Overview</h2><div class="tabcontent"></p><h3>Company Overview</h3><table style="height: 1034px;" width="789"><tbody><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 24px;"><strong>Company</strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 24px;">Kina Securities Limited</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 24px;"><strong>Issuer Code</strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 24px;">KSL</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 24px;"><strong>Industry </strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 24px;">Banking and Finance</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 24px;"><strong>Date Listed</strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 24px;">30/07/2015</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 24px;"><strong>Exempt Foreign Entity?</strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 24px;">No</td></tr><tr style="height: 670px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 670px;"><strong>Overview</strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 670px;"><p style="text-align: justify;">Kina is a diversified financial services provider in Papua New Guinea, offering customers end-to-end financial solutions, from savings accounts to small business loans, investments to mortgages, stockbroking and financial advice, investment management and fund administration.</p><p style="text-align: justify;">Established in 1985, Kina has grown in parallel with Papua New Guinea’s emerging economy, evolving and maturing in tandem with the market. In May 2015, Kina agreed to acquire Maybank PNG, the Papua New Guinea banking operations of Malayan Banking Berhad. Following the acquisition, Kina has operated through two business divisions: Kina Wealth Management and Kina Bank.</p><p style="text-align: justify;">With the addition of Maybank PNG, Kina is:</p><ul style="text-align: justify;"><li>The second largest bank in Papua New Guinea, with more than 11,000 clients and eleven branches</li><li>The largest wealth management business in Papua New Guinea, with over K11 billion of FUM as at March 2015</li><li>It is the largest fund administrator in Papua New Guinea, administering accounts on behalf of more than 938,000 beneficiaries</li><li>The leading stockbroking company in Papua New Guinea, transacting approximately 62 per cent of trades on PNGX in 2014.</li></ul></td></tr><tr style="height: 20px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 20px;"><strong>Internet Address</strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 20px;"><a href="http://www.kina.com.pg/">www.kina.com.pg</a></td></tr><tr style="height: 10px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 10px;"><strong>Registered Office Address<br /> </strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 10px;">Harbour City Level 2, Port Moresby</td></tr><tr style="height: 26px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 26px;"><strong>Postal Address</strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 26px;">PO Box 1141, Port Moresby NCD 121, PNG</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 24px;"><strong>Head Office Number</strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 24px;">+675 308 3888</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 24px;"><strong>Head Office Facsimile</strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 24px;">+675 308 3899</td></tr><tr style="height: 109px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 109px;"><strong>Share Registry </strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 109px;"><p>PNG Registries Limited, Level 4, Cuthbertson House, Cuthbertson Street</p><p>P.O BOX 1265, Port Moresby, Papua New Guinea</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 251px; height: 24px;"><strong>Share Registry Number</strong></td><td style="width: 531px; height: 24px;">+675 321 6377</td></tr></tbody></table><table style="width: 713px;"><tbody><tr style="height: 56px;"><td style="width: 687px; height: 56px;" colspan="2"><h3><strong>DIRECTORS/ SENIOR MANAGEMENT </strong></h3></td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 256px; height: 24px;"><strong> Mr. Ian Clough</strong></td><td style="width: 431px; height: 24px;">Chairman of the Board, Non-Executive Director</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 256px; height: 24px;"><strong>Mr. Richard Kimber</strong></td><td style="width: 431px; height: 24px;">Deputy Chair of the Board, Non-Executive Director</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 256px; height: 24px;"><strong>Mr. Ivan Vidovich</strong></td><td style="width: 431px; height: 24px;">Chief Executive Officer / Managing Director</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 256px; height: 24px;"><strong>Mr. Andrew Carriline </strong></td><td style="width: 431px; height: 24px;">Non-Executive Director</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 256px; height: 24px;"><strong>Mr. Paul Hutchinson </strong></td><td style="width: 431px; height: 24px;">Non-Executive Director</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 256px; height: 24px;"><strong>Ms. Karen Smith-Pomeroy</strong></td><td style="width: 431px; height: 24px;">Non-Executive Director</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 256px; height: 24px;"><strong>Dr. Jane Thomason</strong></td><td style="width: 431px; height: 24px;">Non-Executive Director</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 256px; height: 24px;"><strong>Mr. Robert Nilkare, OBE OL</strong></td><td style="width: 431px; height: 24px;">Non- Executive Director</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 256px; height: 24px;"><strong>Mr. Lutz Heil</strong></td><td style="width: 431px; height: 24px;">Non-Executive Director</td></tr><tr style="height: 56px;"><td style="width: 687px; height: 56px;" colspan="2"><h3><strong>Company Secretary</strong></h3></td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 256px; height: 24px;"><strong>Mr. Taiwo Fowowe</strong></td><td style="width: 431px; height: 24px;"> Company Secretary</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="sharedaddy sd-sharing-enabled"><div class="robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon sd-sharing"><h3 class="sd-title">Share this:</h3><div class="sd-content"><ul><li class="share-twitter"><a rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"
